"lstnumberx6.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">)</span><span id="lstnumberx6.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;"> </span><span id="lstnumberx6.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:80%;">{</span>
</div>
